.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Generic \fBTest\fP for any FEM subclass\&. 


.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
Philipp Lang
.RE
.PP
Uses the \fBFiniteElement_TestData\fP class to test FEMs\&. Please see there for instructions on the text file that is used for testing\&.

.PP
